id: super-android-super-weapon
name: Super Weapon
order: 1
slot: trait
description: >
  Your upgrades have transformed you into a walking weapon of mass destruction.
text: >
  Super Weapon: Your upgrades have transformed you into a walking weapon of mass destruction.
  (1)-[Passive]: While you are at the Healthy Health Threshold, increase your Combat Rolls and Damage Reduction by 1(T).
  (2)-[Passive]: While your Ki Points are below 1/4 (rounded up) of your Maximum Ki Points, increase your Surgency by 2(T).
  (3)-[Passive]: Upon gaining this Transformation, select and gain access to an additional effect from the 3rd effect of Technological Being.
  (4)-[Triggered, Resource]: When you use the Energy Charge Maneuver, gain a stack of Reserved Energy (max. 6).
  (5)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: When you use a Signature Technique, you may spend any number of Reserved Energy stacks. Increase the Wound Roll of that Attacking Maneuver by 1(T) for each stack of Reserved Energy spent this way.
  (6)-[Triggered/Power, 1/Round]: You may spend any number of Reserved Energy stacks to regain 1(bT) Ki Points for each stack of Reserved Energy spent.
  (7)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you spend 3+ stacks of Reserved Energy through the 5th effect of Super Weapon, apply an Energy Charge to that Attacking Maneuver for every 3 stacks of Reserved Energy spent.
  (8)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you spend 3+ stacks of Reserved Energy through the 6th effect of Super Weapon, use a Healing Surge as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

---

# Written, not applied yet: its effects arrive with its stage (the plan).
